  {
    "title": "Anti-Strip Back-zip Jumpsuit - Adaptive Alzheimer’s and Dementia Clothing",
    "handle": "anti-strip-back-zip-jumpsuit-adaptive-alzheimers-and-dementia-clothing",
    "description": "<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"173\">🎉 <strong>For a Limited Time, almost $30 OFF per jumpsuit</strong><strong data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"115\">!</strong> 🎉</p>\n<p><strong>No codes needed—your discount applies automatically at checkout.</strong></p>\n<p>Looking for comfortable and functional clothing designed for <strong>ease of use</strong> and practicality? Our <strong>adaptive back zip senior or special needs clothing</strong> is thoughtfully crafted to support caregivers and their loved ones, offering innovative features that simplify dressing and promote comfort.</p>\n<p>This <strong>anti-strip onesie</strong> is designed with a discrete <strong>back zipper</strong> for easy dressing and secure wear, making it an ideal solution for <strong>maintaining dignity and independence</strong>. It provides a practical and stylish option for caregivers seeking user-friendly clothing.</p>\n<p>Made with premium <strong>95% cotton</strong> and a touch of spandex for flexibility (no polyester), this adaptive wear ensures maximum comfort throughout the day. Features like elasticated openings for a gentle fit and label space for easy identification make it a practical choice for use at home or in care settings.</p>\n<p>Available in unisex sizes (X-Small, Small, Medium, Large), this adaptive clothing is designed to fit comfortably and accommodate various needs. Its relaxed fit and high-quality fabric make it a versatile addition to any wardrobe.</p>\n<p>Choose from two sleek colors: Navy Blue and Burgundy.</p>\n<p>For more information on how the product works, check out our <a rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Anti-strip jumpsuit for dementia care\" href=\"https://youtu.be/RLMUzeZDzlM\" target=\"_blank\">youtube</a><a title=\"Anti-strip jumpsuit for dementia care\" href=\"https://youtu.be/RLMUzeZDzlM\"> video</a>!</p>\n<p><strong>Size Down! Sizes run large</strong><span><strong> </strong>for a comfortable, loose fit.</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.dementiaaide.com/pages/sizing-chart-anti-strip-jumpsuit\" title=\"Anti Strip Jumpsuit Dementia Alzheimer's Sizing Chart\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Sizing Chart</a></p>\n<p><strong>Features include:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Discrete back zipper with loops extending to the front for easy dressing</li>\n<li>Elasticated openings designed for a gentle fit, suitable for those with swelling or sensitive skin</li>\n<li>Label space for easy identification in care settings</li>\n<li>Soft, breathable fabric for all-day comfort</li>\n<li>Made with 95% cotton and 5% spandex for flexibility and durability</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"177\">🧵 SIZE TIP 🧵</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"206\"></strong><strong data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"206\">This style runs large.</strong><br data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"209\"><span>👉 For the best fit, we recommend </span><strong data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"259\">sizing down.</strong></p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"259\"><a href=\"https://www.dementiaaide.com/pages/sizing-chart-anti-strip-jumpsuit\" title=\"Anti Strip Jumpsuit Dementia Alzheimer's Sizing Chart\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Sizing Chart</a></strong><em><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"></span></em></p>\n<p><strong><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"> <span>🚚💨</span>FREE Standard Shipping + Returns + Exchanges</strong></p>",
