  {
    "title": "Alzheimer’s Awareness Clothing | Baseball Hat “Find a Cure” | Dementia Awareness Apparel",
    "handle": "alzheimer-s-awareness-clothing-hat",
    "description": "<p>10% of proceeds from this product are donated to the Alzheimer's Association. </p>\n<p>Show your support in style with our Alzheimer’s awareness clothing baseball hat, designed to spread hope and raise visibility for a cure. This comfortable, everyday cap is part of our dementia awareness clothing collection, perfect for Alzheimer’s walks, fundraising events, or simply as daily clothes Alzheimer’s awareness.<br><br>Crafted with high-quality materials, this unisex design makes it easy to represent the cause wherever you go. Whether you’re looking for Alzheimer’s awareness clothing for women, Alzheimer’s awareness clothes in purple, or versatile gear to pair with other outfits, this baseball hat is the ideal choice.<br><br>✅ Embroidered with “Find a Cure” for Alzheimer’s<br>✅ Adjustable strap for a comfortable fit<br>✅ Perfect for walks, community events, and everyday wear<br>✅ Matches with Alzheimer’s awareness clothing purple and more</p>\n<p><br>Join the movement—this hat is more than just clothing; it’s a voice for awareness, dignity, and change.<br><br>• 100% chino cotton twill<br>• Green Camo color is 35% chino cotton twill, 65% polyester<br>• Unstructured, 6-panel, low-profile<br>• 6 embroidered eyelets<br>• 3 ⅛” (7.6 cm) crown<br>• Adjustable strap with antique buckle<br><br>This product is made especially for you as soon as you place an order, which is why it takes us a bit longer to deliver it to you. Making products on demand instead of in bulk helps reduce overproduction, so thank you for making thoughtful purchasing decisions!</p>\n<p><strong class=\"size-guide-title\">Size guide</strong></p>\n<div data-unit-system=\"imperial\" class=\"table-responsive dynamic\">\n<table cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td> </td>\n<td><strong>A (inches)</strong></td>\n<td><strong>B (inches)</strong></td>\n<td><strong>C (inches)</strong></td>\n<td><strong>D (inches)</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>One size</strong></td>\n<td>20 ½-24 ⅜</td>\n<td>4 ¾</td>\n<td>3 ⅛</td>\n<td>7 ½</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>",
